Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Interface|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Interface|
		|pageName|CKEditor Page|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Blogs Entry With Image Via Blogs Images
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Blogs add Entry With Uploaded Cover Image
		|coverImageName|Document_1|
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entrySubtitle|Blogs Entry Subtitle|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|navTab|Upload Image|
		|uploadFileName|Document_1.jpg|
	And Pause at locator '1000'
	And BlogsEntry save As Draft
	And Click at locator 'BlogsEditEntry#DELETE_COVER_IMAGE_BUTTON'
	And Click pause Click At at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_ADD_BUTTON'
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_ADD_MENUBAR_IMAGE'
	And ItemSelector select Blog Image
		|imageFileName|Document_1.jpg|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	Then AssertElementPresent at locator '//div[contains(@class,'entry-content')]/p/img[contains(@src,'Document_1.jpg')]'
Scenario: Add Web Content Article With Image Via URL
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And Type the value 'Web Content Title' at locator 'TextInput#TITLE'
	And Click pause Click At at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_ADD_BUTTON'
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_ADD_MENUBAR_IMAGE'
	And ItemSelector add From URL
		|imageSourceURL|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liferay/liferay-portal/master/portal-web/test/functional/com/liferay/portalweb/dependencies/Document_1.jpg|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContentNavigator goto Preview Entry CP
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#DIALOG'
	Then AssertElementPresent at locator '//img[contains(@src,'Document_1.jpg')]'
Scenario: View Wiki Front Page Left To Right
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WikiPage add Localized Front Page PG
		|emptyPageMessage|This page is empty. Edit it to add some text.|
		|successMessage|Your request completed successfully.|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Left to Right Content|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	Then WikiPage view Localized Front Page PG
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Left to Right Content|
Scenario: View Wiki Front Page Right To Left
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|WYSIWIGUsecase#ViewWikiFrontPageRightToLeft|
	When Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Language Selector|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|Hebrew (Israel)|
	And WikiPage add Localized Front Page PG
		|emptyPageMessage|דף זה ריק. ערוך אותו על מנת להוסיף טקסט|
		|rtl|true|
		|successMessage|בקשתך עברה בהצלחה|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Right to Left תוֹכֶן|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And WikiPage view Localized Front Page PG
		|rightToLeft|true|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Right to Left תוֹכֶן|
	Then LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|English (United States)|

